# NOTE: this repo is PRIVATE and the owner has chosen to keep everything,
# including credential recipes and live scan data. Nothing is excluded.
#
# If this is ever made public, delete this file before doing anything else:
# *.recipe.json, state/, *.jsonl and the findings/coverage/knowledge/*.json files
# contain real credentials and real responses from real targets.
#
# One local-only exclusion, so a stray Playwright download or editor swap file
# never lands in history.

node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# Per-target reports. reports/<domain>/ holds reconnaissance against real
# third-party systems — subdomain enumeration and live findings. That data
# belongs to an engagement, not to a backup repo, and must never be committed.
# The local lab uses state/, which is tracked on purpose.
reports/
